{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Y3uAVJATIn1795137957.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>海南三亞蜈支洲島旅遊區十多年來致力修復珊瑚生態，成效顯著，近年吸引越來越多海洋生物前來棲息。</p><p></p><p>熊貓海兔、絲帶鰻，還有網紋多彩海牛，這些平常少見的海洋生物，如今在海南三亞蜈支洲海域都有機會看到。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.HN.OCEAN.1106-HOLD_CLEAN_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BbGqaK471L1795138040.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>蜈支洲島旅遊區自2010年起，啟動海洋牧場建設和珊瑚修復，累計投放逾八萬立方米人工魚礁和船礁等，移植珊瑚七萬多株，修復海洋生態面積超過6.3萬平方米。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.HN.OCEAN.1106-HOLD_CLEAN_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026x5zPQEYLz51795138065.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>三亞蜈支洲島旅遊區珊瑚保育員王豐國稱︰「建設這個海洋牧場最終目的，說實話就是為了恢復我們蜈支洲島海域的海洋生態環境，尤其是針對魚類資源，當然還有比如說珊瑚，以及其他的海洋生物，對維護這個生態鏈的一個閉環，起到一個非常重要的作用。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.HN.OCEAN.1106-HOLD_CLEAN_4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZxSBwDEDoa1795138080.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他說當地漁業資源較修復前多了兩倍，甚至觀測到黑鰭鯊等頻繁造訪。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:43:53.654796+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T01:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:21.503967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:15.945909+00:00","content_hash":"3297b00dfe356afd9e77b900d1393dcb6a98caa51ef11f7fefcaea69bebf2afb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:43:53.654796+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}